---

{%- macro categoryLabel(cat) -%}
{%- if cat == "graphics" -%}GRAPHICS{%- elseif cat == "marketing" -%}MARKETING & ADVERTISING{%- elseif cat == "tech" -%}TECH PLANNING{%- elseif cat == "websites" -%}WEBSITES{%- endif -%}
{%- endmacro -%}

{%- macro renderProject(project) -%}
<article class="pc-project" id="project-{{ project.id }}" data-project-categories="{{ project.categories.join(' ') }}"><a class="project-shot" href="{{ project.sourceUrl }}" aria-label="View {{ project.title | safe }} in the original portfolio" data-original-source="true"><img src="{{ project.image }}" alt="{{ project.alt | safe }}" width="{{ project.width }}" height="{{ project.height }}" loading="{{ project.loading }}" decoding="{{ project.decoding }}"></a><div class="pc-project__meta">{{ project.categories.map(categoryLabel).join(' / ') }}</div><h3><a href="{{ project.sourceUrl }}" data-original-source="true">{{ project.title | safe }}<span class="pc-arrow" aria-hidden="true"><svg viewBox="0 0 16 16"><path d="M4 12l8-8M4 4h8v8"/></svg></span></a></h3>{%- if project.description -%}<p>{{ project.description | safe }}</p>{%- endif -%}</article>
{%- endmacro -%}

<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en" data-page="{{ dataPage }}">
<head>
{%- include "components/head-meta.njk" %}
</head>
<body class="portfolio-category-page portfolio-complete">
  <a class="skip-link" href="#main">Skip to main content</a>
{%- include "components/site-header.njk" %}
  <main id="main">
<section class="inner-page-hero pc-hero" aria-labelledby="page-title"><div class="container inner-page-hero__grid"><div class="inner-page-hero__content reveal"><p class="eyebrow">Portfolio / GLN Projects</p><h1 class="inner-page-hero__title" id="page-title">Creative thinking.<br>Real-world impact.</h1><p class="inner-page-hero__text">A collection of ideas, creativity, and digital work. Explore the original project library across design, marketing, technology planning, and websites.</p><div class="inner-page-hero__cta"><a href="#projects" class="link-arrow">Explore Projects<span class="link-arrow__icon" aria-hidden="true"><svg viewBox="0 0 16 16"><path d="M4 12l8-8M4 4h8v8"/></svg></span></a></div></div><div class="inner-page-hero__visual reveal"><figure class="inner-page-hero__primary"><img src="assets/images/portfolio/gln/seattle-chihuly-detail.jpg" alt="Seattle Chihuly campaign artwork from the original Get Lagos Now portfolio" width="1024" height="683" fetchpriority="high" decoding="async"></figure><figure class="inner-page-hero__detail"><img src="assets/images/portfolio/gln/seattle-space-needle-detail.jpg" alt="Seattle Space Needle project artwork from the original portfolio" width="1024" height="683" decoding="async"></figure></div></div></section>
<section class="pc-intro section"><div class="container pc-intro__grid"><div><p class="eyebrow">Ideas made tangible</p><h2 class="h2">Creative and technical.<br>Thoughtfully connected.</h2></div><div class="pc-intro__copy"><p>Explore 39 projects from Get Lagos Now's original portfolio. Each entry retains its published name and categories, with original artwork and a link to the source project.</p><p class="pc-source-note">Some source entries contain only a title and visual. Those projects retain their concise presentation here. <a href="https://getlagosnow.com/my-portfolio/" data-original-source="true">View the original project library</a>.</p></div></div></section>
<section class="section" aria-labelledby="creative-title"><div class="container"><header class="section-head"><p class="eyebrow">Selected creative</p><h2 id="creative-title" class="h2">A closer look<br>at creative thinking.</h2></header><div class="gln-featured"><figure><a href="https://getlagosnow.com/featured_item/seattle-chihuly/" class="project-shot" data-original-source="true"><img src="assets/images/portfolio/gln/seattle-chihuly-detail.jpg" alt="Seattle Chihuly photography and social media creative by Michelle Lagos" width="480" height="640" loading="lazy"></a><figcaption class="pc-caption">Seattle Chihuly / Photography &amp; social media</figcaption></figure><div class="pc-feature__copy"><p class="eyebrow">From original photography to campaign creative</p><h3 class="pc-project-title pc-project-title--medium">Creative work,<br>in context.</h3><p>Seattle Chihuly documents photography and social media ads by Michelle Lagos. New Avenues for Youth documents digital marketing campaigns. Both projects appear in the complete collection below.</p><a href="#projects" class="link-arrow">Browse the project collection<span class="link-arrow__icon" aria-hidden="true"><svg viewBox="0 0 16 16"><path d="M4 12l8-8M4 4h8v8"/></svg></span></a></div></div></div></section>
<section class="section" id="projects" aria-labelledby="library-title"><div class="container"><header class="section-head section-head--split"><div><p class="eyebrow">Complete project collection</p><h2 class="h2" id="library-title">A breadth of work.<br>A shared approach.</h2></div><p class="pc-section-note">Browse every original portfolio entry, including projects that span multiple disciplines.</p></header><div class="gln-controls" role="group" aria-label="Filter projects by category"><button type="button" class="gln-filter" data-gln-filter="all" aria-pressed="true">ALL</button><button type="button" class="gln-filter" data-gln-filter="graphics" aria-pressed="false">GRAPHICS</button><button type="button" class="gln-filter" data-gln-filter="marketing" aria-pressed="false">MARKETING &amp; ADVERTISING</button><button type="button" class="gln-filter" data-gln-filter="tech" aria-pressed="false">TECH PLANNING</button><button type="button" class="gln-filter" data-gln-filter="websites" aria-pressed="false">WEBSITES</button></div><p class="gln-count" data-gln-count role="status" aria-live="polite">39 projects</p><div class="gln-grid" data-gln-grid>{%- for project in glnProjects %}{{ renderProject(project) }}{%- endfor %}</div><div class="gln-more-wrap"><button class="btn btn--dark gln-more" type="button" data-gln-more hidden>Load More Projects</button></div></div></section><section class="pc-explore section"><div class="container"><header class="section-head"><p class="eyebrow">Explore more work</p><h2 class="h2">Different industries.<br>Shared commitment.</h2></header><nav class="pc-explore__grid" aria-label="Other portfolio categories"><a href="work.html" class="pc-category-link"><span><small>Selected websites, branding &amp; marketing</small><strong>All Projects</strong></span><span class="pc-arrow" aria-hidden="true"><svg viewBox="0 0 16 16"><path d="M4 12l8-8M4 4h8v8"/></svg></span></a><a href="portfolio-energy-efficiency.html" class="pc-category-link"><span><small>Clean technology &amp; related industries</small><strong>Energy Efficiency</strong></span><span class="pc-arrow" aria-hidden="true"><svg viewBox="0 0 16 16"><path d="M4 12l8-8M4 4h8v8"/></svg></span></a><a href="portfolio-nonprofit.html" class="pc-category-link"><span><small>Digital experiences for meaningful missions</small><strong>Non-Profit</strong></span><span class="pc-arrow" aria-hidden="true"><svg viewBox="0 0 16 16"><path d="M4 12l8-8M4 4h8v8"/></svg></span></a><a href="portfolio-medical-dental.html" class="pc-category-link"><span><small>Human-centered healthcare</small><strong>Medical &amp; Dental</strong></span><span class="pc-arrow" aria-hidden="true"><svg viewBox="0 0 16 16"><path d="M4 12l8-8M4 4h8v8"/></svg></span></a></nav></div></section>{% include "components/cta-banner.njk" %}
  </main>
{%- include "components/site-footer.njk" %}
<script src="{{ prefix }}assets/js/main.js" defer></script>
<script src="{{ prefix }}assets/js/portfolio-library.js" defer></script>
</body>
</html>
